  "body_html": "<h1>Strategic Game</h1>\n<p>A strategic game (or normal-form game) is a tuple\n\\((I, (S_i)_{i \\in I}, (u_i)_{i \\in I})\\)\nwhere \\(I\\) is a set of players, \\(S_i\\) is the strategy set of player \\(i\\), and\n\\(u_i \\colon \\prod_{j \\in I} S_j \\to U\\) is the payoff function of player \\(i\\).</p>\n<p>In the Lean formalization, this is a structure with fields <code>strategy : ι → Type*</code> and\n<code>payoff : Profile → ι → U</code>, where <code>Profile = ∀ i, strategy i</code>.</p>",
